PlaceStation - Open Source License Summary
============================================

PlaceStation is composed of multiple components released under different
open-source licenses. This umbrella file lists which license applies to which
part. Full license texts are in the licenses/ directory.

  ===========================================================================
  Component                                  License            License file
  ===========================================================================
  Hardware design files (CAD, STEP, STL)     CERN-OHL-W v2      licenses/CERN-OHL-W-v2.txt
  PCB design files (Gerbers, schematics)     CERN-OHL-W v2      licenses/CERN-OHL-W-v2.txt
  Firmware (Marlin fork)                     GPLv3              licenses/GPL-v3.txt
  Software (OpenPnP plugin)                  GPLv3              licenses/GPL-v3.txt
  Software (gear-ratio calibration tool)     MIT                licenses/MIT.txt
  Software (OpenPnP configuration files)     MIT                licenses/MIT.txt
  Documentation (README, CHANGES, etc.)      CC BY-SA 4.0       licenses/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt
  ===========================================================================

Folder-level license mapping:

  hardware/         CERN-OHL-W v2 (see per-folder README for upstream notices)
  pcb/              CERN-OHL-W v2
  firmware/         GPLv3
  software/openpnp/photon-pocket-calibration/   GPLv3
  software/openpnp/gear-ratio-tool/             MIT
  software/openpnp/machine-config/              MIT
  reference/        CC BY-SA 4.0

